  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting for exploring options for an old-age social pension, capacity buidling and advocacy for elderly rights in the occupied Palestinian Territory (BEY/TOM- Request for approval ofproposed implementing partner4 with HelpAge International PSE/19/50/UN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action supports the ILO and UN partners&apos; response to our quest from the MoSD to explore options for designing and implementing a social pension for elderly Palestinians and will contribute to a broader policy dialogue on social protection under ongoing technical assistance activities. It combines objectives from across pillars of the relevant UNJP to grow the evidence base and develop the necessary policy frameworks and programmatic tools needed to strengthen capacity within government and NGOs to enhance social protection for older persons, in line with stated government objectives.</narrative>
  </description>
